@@ -0,0 +1,91 @@
+/* Copyright 2026 Alexander Pukhov
+ *
+ * This file is part of openPMD-api.
+ *
+ * openPMD-api is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify
+ * it under the terms of of either the GNU General Public License or
